{"id":"featuregrid","code":"<style>.fgr{width:340px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:14px 6px}\n.fgr .badge{display:inline-block;background:rgba(51,102,255,.12);color:var(--accent,#3366FF);border:1px solid rgba(51,102,255,.3);font:600 10px Inter,sans-serif;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:99px}\n.fgr h2{margin:10px 0 6px;color:var(--ink,#fff);font:800 20px Inter,sans-serif;line-height:1.15}\n.fgr .sub{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:400 11px Inter,sans-serif;line-height:1.5}\n.fgr .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n.fgr .t{border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);background:var(--card,#171B22);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\n.fgr .t .ic{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(51,102,255,.12);color:var(--accent,#3366FF);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:14px}\n.fgr .t h3{margin:0;color:var(--ink,#fff);font:700 11px Inter,sans-serif}\n.fgr .t p{margin:0;color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:400 9px Inter,sans-serif;line-height:1.4}</style>\n<div class=\"fgr\"><span class=\"badge\">Feature highlights</span><h2>Surface the value behind every capability</h2><p class=\"sub\">Map six differentiators with equal weight across a tidy, responsive grid.</p><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"t\"><span class=\"ic\">🌐</span><h3>Global defaults</h3><p>Native-feeling copy and spacing.</p></div><div class=\"t\"><span class=\"ic\">▧</span><h3>Two-row layout</h3><p>Balanced rows, graceful collapse.</p></div><div class=\"t\"><span class=\"ic\">⤳</span><h3>Meaningful icons</h3><p>Any icon, no extra deps.</p></div><div class=\"t\"><span class=\"ic\">🚀</span><h3>Badge-ready</h3><p>Flag launches and betas.</p></div><div class=\"t\"><span class=\"ic\">📊</span><h3>Quantify impact</h3><p>Show savings and adoption.</p></div><div class=\"t\"><span class=\"ic\">🛟</span><h3>Support friendly</h3><p>Room for a helper link.</p></div></div></div>"}